Subject: [PATCH] Collect on-demand AP link reports without a prior reporting policy

Use the native requested BSS inventory rather than the periodic-policy cache.
Sample actual HAL associations before encoding and retain collection age;
failed collections do not publish cached stations as fresh evidence.

Upstream-Status: Pending

